To create a high-end, 3D interactive experience, I will use **Three.js**, the industry standard for WebGL graphics. This website will feature a floating, interactive 3D geometric core that responds to mouse movement, representing the "neural" complexity of AbyxV2 9B, set against a deep space aesthetic.

